@baseUrl = http://localhost:7777/clasificaciones

### Create a Clasificacion (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 6,
  "lugarInicio": "Bogotá",
  "precio": 100,
  "fechaDisponibilidadInicio": "2025-10-01T09:00:00",
  "fechaDisponibilidadFin": "2025-12-01T18:00:00",
  "capacidadMaxima": 200
}

###

### Get the Clasificacion by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/6
Accept: application/json

###

### Update the Clasificacion
PUT {{baseUrl}}/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 6,
  "lugarInicio": "Medellín",
  "precio": 150,
  "fechaDisponibilidadInicio": "2025-11-01T08:00:00",
  "fechaDisponibilidadFin": "2026-01-15T18:00:00",
  "capacidadMaxima": 300
}

###

### Delete the Clasificacion
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/6

###

### Try to get deleted Clasificacion (should return 404 or equivalent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/6
Accept: application/json
